    "scope": "Legacy finite/algebraic spine plus general exchangeable residual coverage, filtered Ville/predictable betting, KL/TV finite-product testing, concentration, and measurable target-law frontier. The historical full one-bit/H extension is not closed and is not claimed by the compact paper.",
